        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/7ab992/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-22T18:37:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I apologzie in advance if this is the result of my missing something in the rulle book. &nbsp;I looked through but can't find a way the scenarios address balance. &nbsp;In the introductory scenario, for example, Baron Blade has two turns when fighting two heroes. &nbsp;Makes sense as he has to do a lot more. &nbsp;But he also only has two turns when fighting up to four heroes. &nbsp;The only thing that seems to change is how many times they need to incapacitate him. &nbsp;Am I reading this correctly or is there another balancing factor that I'm not considering?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:20.754Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
