        "created_at": "2014-08-22T19:15:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Also note that scenario 1 is supposed to be slightly easier for heros, where as scenario 2/3 is supposed to favor Baron Blade a little more. You will see this sort of thing happen through most scenarios.&nbsp;</p><p>Omnitron scenario 1 favors him more than his scenario 2 which tends to edge out more toward heros.&nbsp;</p><p>You won't find a 100% balance in any of these things, but it is still very competitive and thats the goal</p>",
